flowchart TD
  O[Organizer] --> C1[Create Conference]
  C1 --> UG{First Conference?}
  UG -->|Yes| U1[Auto-Upgrade to Organizer\nToken Refresh]
  UG -->|No| S1
  U1 --> S1[Configure Settings\nBasics, Dates, Visibility]

  S1 --> CFP[Configure CFP\nRequirements, Categories, Types, Questions]
  CFP --> PUB1[Publish Conference - Public Visibility]

  PUB1 --> R1[Review Submissions]
  R1 --> D1{Decision}
  D1 -->|Accept| A1[Mark Accepted]
  D1 -->|Reject| RJ1[Mark Rejected]
  D1 -->|Request Revision| RV1[Send Feedback\nStatus: Revision Requested]
  RV1 --> R1

  A1 --> SCH1[Build Schedule\nDays → Sessions → Presentations]
  SCH1 --> PUB2[Publish Schedule]
